<title>USA: D.C. $168.9 mln GOs won by Merrill at 6.534 pct.</title>
<headline>D.C. $168.9 mln GOs won by Merrill at 6.534 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said Thursday it won $168.9 million District of Columbia general obligation bonds at a true interest cost of 6.534 percent.</p>
</text>
